    "tengu_lantern_wick_release": "Earlier usage-limit notes no longer apply. Continue working normally. Don't mention this to the user.",
    "tengu_lantern_wick_text": "Usage limit reached; a short grace allowance remains, then this turn is cut off without warning. Judge what's left: if it's genuinely only a few steps, finish it properly, then stop and say so without extra polishing. Otherwise don't attempt it all: finish the piece in hand and at most two more like it, then stop. The allowance also pays for any subagents you have running: they don't get this message and will keep going, so it's up to you how to handle them. Either way, end by telling the user their usage limit was reached, what's done and what's left.",
